<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Ssangyong Cement H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ssangyong Cement H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   461  vs 278</p>
<p>    Net					 15.37  vs 9.07</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     16.29  vs 9.18</p>
<p>    Revenue				  715.41  vs 669.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Ssangyong Cement Industrial Co Ltd, a unit of the Ssangyong Group, is South Korea's largest cement manufacturer which began operations in 1962. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
